    <description>Record-triggered Omni-Channel SKILLS-BASED routing flow. Fires on VoiceCall insert and calls the standard routeWork invocable action with routingType=SkillsBased and a non-null skillOption to create a PendingServiceRouting for the new VoiceCall, then routes by skill. With skillOption=RunSBRRules (default) the platform evaluates the org's WorkSkillRouting (skills-based routing) rules server-side and attaches the matching SkillRequirement rows to the PSR; skillOption is REQUIRED here (a null skillOption makes the platform routeWork action NPE and roll back the VoiceCall insert - W-24069761), so this asset always carries it. The org-specific IDs (serviceChannelId, queueId, routingConfigId) and the skillOption are tokenized and resolved at deploy time so the asset is portable across orgs. Deployed by service-omni-routing-flow-deploy with --routing-type SkillsBased. This is the skills-based production routing variant; Omni_Route_VoiceCall_Trigger is the queue-based variant.</description>
